    <item>
      <title>Who Is the Mexican Drug Kingpin Known as El Chapo Isidro?</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/21/world/americas/mexico-el-chapo-isidro-drug-kingpin.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/21/world/americas/mexico-el-chapo-isidro-drug-kingpin.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:16:39 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/21/multimedia/21int-cartel-arrest-zqtf/21int-cartel-arrest-zqtf-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg" />
      <media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/21/multimedia/21int-cartel-arrest-zqtf/21int-cartel-arrest-zqtf-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" medium="image" />
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/21/multimedia/21int-cartel-arrest-zqtf/21int-cartel-arrest-zqtf-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:10px;" alt="Who Is the Mexican Drug Kingpin Known as El Chapo Isidro?" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The kingpin, Fausto Isidro Meza Flores, was captured in a violent operation in Mexico. He was one of the F.B.I.’s 10 most wanted fugitives.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
