    <item>
      <title>Tech Outages Are Only the Beginning. A.I. Will Bring More Disruptions.</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/21/us/politics/tech-outages-ai-disruptions.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/21/us/politics/tech-outages-ai-disruptions.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:11:51 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/21/multimedia/21DC-OUTAGE-topart-sub-wghl/21DC-OUTAGE-topart-sub-wghl-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg" />
      <media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/21/multimedia/21DC-OUTAGE-topart-sub-wghl/21DC-OUTAGE-topart-sub-wghl-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" medium="image" />
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/21/multimedia/21DC-OUTAGE-topart-sub-wghl/21DC-OUTAGE-topart-sub-wghl-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:10px;" alt="Tech Outages Are Only the Beginning. A.I. Will Bring More Disruptions." /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cybersecurity has been an afterthought since the early days of the internet. Now A.I. is uncovering dormant problems, making the bill come due for decades of vulnerable code.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <source url="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/21/us/politics/tech-outages-ai-disruptions.html">The New York Times</source>
    </item>
